cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "RNA-seq differential expression pipeline: wild-type vs Brca1+/- female mouse liver on a high-fat diet"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible bulk RNA-seq workflow (SRA download, FastQC and fastp quality control,
  Salmon quantification against the Ensembl 102 GRCm38 transcriptome, tximport and DESeq2
  differential expression, exploratory fgsea pathway analysis) applied to liver from female
  wild-type and Brca1+/- mice fed a 60% high-fat diet (GEO series GSE324339, n = 6 per group).
  Includes the analysis scripts, quantification files and result tables.
authors:
